Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Episode 1
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Opening~!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Title,0000,0000,0000,,Wishful Girl
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Let‘s try to reduce our garbage.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Cellphone,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Pre-school
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Hiragana,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato. (ha! -Z)
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Words,0000,0000,0000,,Next. Radiance of Confetti
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:51.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s starting now, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:54.32,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In order to make my wish come true,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:59.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:39.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:46.08,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,We’ve finally arrived at the place where the humans live. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:47.81,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:53.41,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Here, it’ll be decided whether or not your wish will be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:55.31,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You understand this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:57.32,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you understand that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:06.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,why did you have to pick this cramped and narrow place to make your arrival?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:12.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But having a secret discussion at a playground is so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:21.30,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Fun?! I’ll show you something fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:24.89,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:25.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:29.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are places I wish to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:32.46,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you need to do to accomplish this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:36.32,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I need to collect broken hearts and put them in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:40.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If I can’t get the bottle, I can’t do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:42.32,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you need to do to get the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:46.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To find out if I can live here, I have to pass the tests!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:47.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:52.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Today, we will start by checking your human common knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:57.73,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Under my great observation and judgment, the tests have already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:04:00.37,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:01.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.57,0:04:08.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The tests will be graded on how well you can use human common knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s try it and see, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:14.75,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,In this park, you need to show proper springtime behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.29,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:33.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How’s this, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.31,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Sleeping through spring is bug behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:46.22,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Really, can’t you act natural in the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:48.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:50.30,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.81,KM,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Why hasn’t anyone taken the garbage out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:57.43,KM,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,I’m gonna miss the bus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.51,KM,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:01.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.78,KM,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! I’m going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:09.78,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:13.12,KM,Iorgui,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, perfect! The next test!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:20.16,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What will you do with that garbage bag? Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:21.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:28.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Garbage collection… Garbage collection site…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:32.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.30,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.53,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:39.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:40.56,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:55.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The crows are…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:56.79,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They want the garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.67,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t do it fast, you’ll get pecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:02.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The crows…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:05.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,…want…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:07.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,the garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.69,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, crows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.07,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:43.51,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What were you trying to do by calling out the crows?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:48.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They looked hungry, and the sign said to reduce our garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.81,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Your name is not Kobato! Dobato is good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:54.08,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.45,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:57.80,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alone right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.20,KM,Man 2,0000,0000,0000,,Want to grab some tea with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:02.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:04.94,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,I know a good shop in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:08.34,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Flirting in broad daylight, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:09.76,KM,Man 2,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll treat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:12.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Treat me? Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:14.86,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Well, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:15.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t this great, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:25.25,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What did you come here to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But they were going to treat…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:27.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:30.14,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:30.80,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.57,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:36.06,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,You! What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:42.38,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Don’t play games with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:54.16,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:56.36,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,you’re too rowdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:02.46,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,What? She brought a guy with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:09.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, thank{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:12.14,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No one rejoices over being mollycoddled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:21.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was not rejoicing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:26.75,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, can’t blame him for thinking that, seeing how you were grinning from ear to ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:39.33,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,I’m loving this nice weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:43.28,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Because of all the people watching the cherry blossoms, we’re really busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:44.21,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.83,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.24,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Take this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:49.21,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:52.80,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,It was such a cute cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:52.80,KO,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:55.57,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll clear these plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:57.10,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Um, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.37,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,He’s so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:02.69,KM,Woman 2,0000,0000,0000,,How about we ask for his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:03.60,KM,Woman 1,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:04.79,KM,Woman 2,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:10.15,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,You really aren’t very social. If you smiled a little more, you‘d be more popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.88,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t really care about popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.93,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,You’re so unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:19.98,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:21.24,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:31.66,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Fujimoto. What’s wrong, Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:36.10,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,They’re at the preschool again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:39.14,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait! I’ll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:42.47,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry, Boss. Something urgent came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:53.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what is this? Lots of people have gathered here, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.05,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s probably a flower-viewing festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It smells delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:02.28,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:05.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.92,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers are in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.52,0:10:16.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:22.81,KM,Child,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, can you throw the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.81,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:29.54,KM,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, miss{This is also Onee-chan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:31.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:39.50,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:41.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:43.91,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,It can’t be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:45.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I really am sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:49.76,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,And just when there’s nobody else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:55.09,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let me help with your shop as an apology, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:13.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,One beer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:18.93,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,My part-timer suddenly had to take off. You really saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:20.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:23.13,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.40,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Her generosity sure is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:29.57,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Is my nabe ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:31.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.17,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,If you would, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:35.28,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Are you listening to what I’m saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:35.64,KO,Old Man 2,0000,0000,0000,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:36.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:39.00,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry. Could you prepare it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:40.77,KM,Old man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:48.02,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.09,0:11:50.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,the nabe…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:58.19,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like another test. Show me your nabe skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:06.62,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,The water’s not boiling. You can’t put anything in yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.57,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t put the meat in yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:14.02,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you putting milk in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:15.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But it’s good for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.03,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Why chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:20.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you eat sweet things, you’ll be energetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:23.48,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Not natto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:33.81,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,It’s like I’m staring at a picture of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:39.07,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,But it’d be a waste…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:42.86,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:44.52,KM,Old Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,It’s delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:50.20,KM,Old man 2,0000,0000,0000,,It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.08,KM,Old man 2,0000,0000,0000,,Boss, you should try it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:12:56.96,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:00.13,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:01.91,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:02.88,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,It’s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:07.81,KM,Shop Keeper,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, we’ll add this to our menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:10.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.37,KM,Old man 1,0000,0000,0000,,This is impressive for such a young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:16.23,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t get to try any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:19.15,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato is getting too conceited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:39.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Your knowledge of nabe deserves zero points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:40.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:45.18,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But the nabe you made was delicious, and that’s worth 40 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:47.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No way…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:59.40,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,There, there. Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:06.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:10.98,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,He won’t stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:30.22,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not your fault, miss. Don’t worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:35.04,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,This child is always like this at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:40.01,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,We come to this park often so we won’t bother the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.53,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,He can’t sleep until he’s all cried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:43.98,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:48.16,KM,Old woman,0000,0000,0000,,This child used to always be with his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:51.43,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,When he became unhappy, she would sing to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:54.37,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,and he would stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:58.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where is the mother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:02.50,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,She’s working her hardest for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:06.92,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I have to watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:15.59,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,But my singing isn’t good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:19.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:21.85,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,For this child’s sake, please let me sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:28.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But it won’t be the same as his mother’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:38.76,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Could you try, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:41.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:51.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to sing my best, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:23.00,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay. I just made it back to my part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.70,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t worry about it, Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:33.01,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, it’s a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:31.37,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she’s also only good at singing. Just like Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:17:59.34,KM,Man in crowd,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, um… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:06.96,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,That was so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.48,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like he’s done crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.68,0:18:18.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.70,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all thanks to you, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:23.94,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Could you sing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:25.25,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Please sing more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:31.89,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,There’s a stage over there! Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:50.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They gave us so many gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:53.98,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, they did ask you to sing, so it’s fitting that you get gifts in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:19:00.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,About that… About the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:03.78,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:08.29,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:10.17,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:15.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You pulled some insane stunts in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:18.78,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It was only a coincidence that your nabe was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:22.25,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But your song was all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:23.47,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:25.18,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.11,0:19:30.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Didn’t you just say my song was okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.92,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you performed miserably before that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:34.36,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I did my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:41.15,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you barely failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.15,0:19:42.48,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:44.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No way…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:45.78,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:49.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you’re the old lady from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:54.46,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening, young songstress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:57.09,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I’m glad that we’re able to meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:02.22,KM,Old woman,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much for what you did earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:07.09,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:12.64,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,No singing other than his mother’s has ever made him that happy. This was the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.64,0:20:18.48,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,But then, he fell asleep right away in such a pleasant mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:24.55,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Even though you sang for my grandson, we simply returned home without a thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:26.29,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I’m very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:33.28,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,But your song was really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:36.36,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Could you sing it again for me sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:38.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:40.80,KM,Old Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.34,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:03.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:12.50,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:40.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:43.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s the bottle, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.84,0:21:45.27,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:47.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It is real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:47.96,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:53.39,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That old lady’s thanks was worth 100 points. That means you passed the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:56.92,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It really is real, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.12,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t want it, give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:00.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I want it, I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:10.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If I heal wounded hearts and fill this bottle with their fragments…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.87,0:22:13.85,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Your wish will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:17.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you’ve only got the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:18.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.31,0:22:21.02,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato, what is your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:25.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are places I wish to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.05,0:22:27.03,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you need to do to accomplish this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:32.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I need to collect broken hearts and put them in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:35.92,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen… from now on, it’s the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:37.71,KM,Ioryoji,0000,0000,0000,,The end of the road is still far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:41.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:45.99,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t do pointless things. Do you understand, Dobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:51.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How mean! My name is Kobato. Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:54.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato is good enough! No, Dabada!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.21,0:22:56.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, Dabada!
