Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:07.40,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The flowers that bloom in the spring
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:14.04,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The spacious summer skies
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:20.47,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Engraves and glistens
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:26.93,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:33.72,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Even in the rain that falls in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:40.30,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And the day that I shut my window
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:46.83,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My heart is overflowing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:53.50,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Because the light is shining above the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:17:01.44,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Please guide me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:07.90,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}O voice from the great distance
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:11.82,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It seems like it’s smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.66,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It seems like it’s singing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:21.03,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The sound of the echoing breeze
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:27.51,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Happiness and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:34.19,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I embrace them all and continue to walk
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:41.05,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Take my hand along with your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:48.44,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And make a powerful bond
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
